hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"575","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unnees (din) thehrey aur qasr kartey rahey. (Bukhari: 1080)"
"576","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Madina se Makkah ki taraf nikley. To Aap do do rakatein padhtey they yahan tak ke ham Madina wapas aey. Un se kaha gaya: Kya tum ne Makkah mein kuchh qiyaam kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham wahaan das (din) thehrey. (Bukhari: 1081)"
"577","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Mina mein do rakatein padhein aur Abu Bakr aur Umar key sath. Aur Usmaan key sath uski hukumat key shuru hissey mein, phir us ne poori kein. (Bukhari: 1082)"
"578","[AI-translation] Haaritha bin Wahb (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein namaz padhaai jabke Aap sab se zyada aman mein they, Mina mein do rakatein. (Bukhari: 1083)"
"579","[AI-translation] Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, jab un se kaha gaya: Hamein Usmaan (Raziallahu anhu) ne Mina mein chaar rakatein padhaaein. To unhon-ne Istirjaa kya, phir kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath Mina mein do rakatein padhein. Aur main ne Abu Bakr Siddique (Raziallahu anhu) key sath Mina mein do rakatein padhein. Aur main ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) key sath Mina mein do rakatein padhein. To kaash chaar rakatein mein mera hissa do maqbool rakatein hon. (Bukhari: 1084)"
"580","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us aurat key liye jo Allah aur Aakhirat key din par imaan rakhti hai halaal nahi hai ke wo din raat ki raah ka safar karey jabke uskey sath mehram na ho. (Bukhari: 1088)"
"581","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke jab safar mein jaldi hoti to Maghrib moakkhar kartey aur use teen (rakatein) padhtey, phir salaam phertey. Phir thodi der thehartey yahan tak ke Isha key liye iqaamat kehtey aur use do rakatein padhtey, phir salaam phertey. Aur Isha key baad nafl na padhtey yahan tak ke raat key darmiyaan mein uthtey. (Bukhari: 1092)"
"582","[AI-translation] Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nafl padhtey they jabke Aap sawaar they, qibley key siwa (rukh kar key). (Bukhari: 1094)"
"583","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne gadhey par namaz padhi jabke unka chehra qibley key baaen taraf tha. To un se kaha gaya: Tum qibley key siwa (rukh kar key) namaz padhtey ho? To unhon-ne kaha: Agar main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aisa kartey huey na dekha hota to main aisa na karta. (Bukhari: 1100)"
"584","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath raha aur main ne Aap ko safar mein nafl padhtey huey nahi dekha. Aur Allah ne farmaya: (Beshak tumharey liye Rasulullah mein umda namoona hai). (Bukhari: 1101)"
"585","[AI-translation] Aamir bin Rabeea (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap raat ko safar mein apni sawaari ki peeth par nafl padhtey they jidhar wo Aap ko ley jaati. (Bukhari: 1104)"
"586","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar ki namaz aur Asr key darmiyaan jama kartey they jab safar par hotey. Aur Maghrib aur Isha key darmiyaan jama kartey they. (Bukhari: 1107). Imraan bin Husain se riwayat hai, aur wo bawaaseer mein mubtala they. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aadmi ki baith kar namaz padhney key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Agar wo khadey ho kar namaz padhey to afzal hai. Aur jo baith kar namaz padhey to usey khadey honay waley key aadhey ajr key baraabar hai. Aur jo let kar namaz padhey to usey baithney waley key aadhey ajr key baraabar hai. (1115). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"587","[AI-translation] Imraan bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey bawaaseer thi to main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se namaz key baarey mein poochha. To Aap ne farmaya: Khadey ho kar namaz padho. Phir agar taaqat na rakkho to baith kar. Phir agar taaqat na rakkho to karwat par. (Bukhari: 1117)"
"588","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) Ummul Momineen se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko raat ki namaz baith kar padhtey huey kabhi nahi dekha yahan tak ke Aap budhey ho gaey. To Aap baith kar padhtey yahan tak ke jab ruku karna chaahtey to khadey hotey aur tees ya chaalees aayaton key qareeb padhtey, phir ruku kartey. (Bukhari: 1118)"
"589","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) aik riwayat mein hai: Phir doosri rakat mein aisa kartey. Phir jab apni namaz poori kartey to dekhtey. Phir agar main jaag rahi hoti to mujh se baat kartey aur agar main soyi hui hoti to let jaatey. (Bukhari: 1119). Kitaab-ut-Tahajjud."
